{
  "id": 2220,
  "name": "lapoke-ball",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "standard-balls",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/34/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "野生のポケモンに投げて捕まえるためのボール。木の実などを使って手作業で作る。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "야생 포켓몬에게 던지면 잡을 수 있는 신비한 볼. 재료를 모아 공작으로 만든다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "不可思議的球。用於投向野生寶可夢並將其捕捉。需收集材料並透過工藝製作來生產。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une étrange balle qui peut être lancée sur les Pokémon sauvages afin de les capturer. On peut la confectionner à partir de diverses ressources.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein rätselhafter Ball, den man auf wilde Pokémon wirft, um sie zu fangen. Wenn man die nötigen Materialien sammelt, kann man ihn selbst herstellen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Misterioso instrumento con forma de bola que se lanza a un Pokémon salvaje para capturarlo. Puede elaborarse manualmente si se reúnen los materiales necesarios.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Speciale strumento da lanciare come una palla, usato per catturare Pokémon selvatici. Viene creata a mano una volta raccolti tutti i materiali necessari.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A mysterious ball that can be thrown at wild Pokémon in order to catch them. These balls can be crafted by hand if you gather the necessary materials.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "野生のポケモンに投げて捕まえるための不思議なボール。材料を集めてクラフトでつくる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "不可思议的球。用于投向野生宝可梦并将其捕捉。需收集材料并通过工艺制作来生产。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
